### Surgical Replacement vs. Full-File Hallucination

When conversational agents rewrite entire source files, they frequently discard adjacent utility functions, drop subtle comments, or accidentally reintroduce previously patched regressions.

To prevent this, the agent is restricted to contiguous, surgical modifications:
- Exact line-range targeting with strict AST boundary checks.
- Zero whole-file overwrites unless explicitly bootstrapping a new module.
- Immediate post-edit regression execution.

