Flowork OS solves this via Linux Landlock LSM (`/opt/floworkos/policies/`):
- Read/write access is restricted to authorized project paths.
- Critical system configuration paths (`/etc`, `/boot`, `/usr/bin`) and host secret vaults are immutable to the agent runtime.
- Network access can be scoped per task via decoupled MCP connectors.

